#: ../../content/applications/general/process_numbers.rst:63
msgid "Click :guilabel:`New` to create a process number. The number itself is assigned automatically from the *Process Number* sequence (by default `PN/<year>/<5-digit counter>`, e.g., `PN/2026/00042`) and cannot be modified. It is unique per company. Optionally, fill in:"
